{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fd9b5c62f5a9d781a0d2dafda1561319a49b21ef00ff4413ca1ae55c757c938e", "ja": "（『はるみら』の今日の仕事は、配信番組出演。\n収録は滞りなく終わり、ふたりは着替えにいっている）", "zh": "（『はるみら』今天的工作是参加网络节目。\n录制顺利结束，两人现在去换衣服了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "04f14d8900296d2ac5a4cd72fe258d8dbad0c0a96342c1a4d806f930b7beea99", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n今、ちょっとだけお話しできますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n现在能稍微聊两句吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f58e62e6f4e7535032ef9776bccc061eb43ee867ac3068b427dd09f70fe536d1", "ja": "お疲れさま、春香。\nあれ、着替えに行ったんじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，春香。咦，你不是去换衣服了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "09e9f9b4b17ae13a9bbc7c3cd49a28bf0faf6c8908fc72c954695f203d416008", "ja": "はい。{$P$}さんに\nお願いしたいことがあって、戻ってきちゃいました。", "zh": "是的，因为有件事想拜托{$P$}先生，所以就回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "f16f8882f471e6bb58cf68701b8875c155b7e370c57750b065304aefbee4bcb5", "ja": "あ、大したことじゃないんですよ！\nお菓子の試食係をしてほしいだけで……。", "zh": "啊，不是什么大不了的事！\n只是想请您帮忙试吃点心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c6a529deece1e81224e2c2d48d939fe6cfe919aa36d4fce4930fd0687803231e", "ja": "試食係？", "zh": "试吃员？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "a9134d1ae965a46bdb7d3e4e203a8d64acd59c4c4b8693babdbc7bd4e080cd6f", "ja": "はい。さっき、未来ちゃんに聞いたんです。\n新しいお仕事が決まったって。", "zh": "是的。刚才我听未来说了，她接到了新的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1007_p", "source_sha256": "05064820256be69e03fa1cae96049cde2980ad368f56e68dd0f2dccd1bb034a4", "ja": "ああ、そうなんだ。\n未来個人への依頼で、小さいけどCMだ。", "zh": "啊，是这样啊。\n是单独找未来的工作，虽然规模不大，但也是CM。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "d967a495067fa2c5c0dec9d23c3a10b7c54a99d4a5db449aad3bf731f81559c1", "ja": "未来ちゃん、すっごくよろこんでましたよ！\n指名してもらったから、絶対がんばるって。", "zh": "未来特别高兴呢！\n因为被指名了，她说一定会努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "d8ca2aa9ac4e36cca82890ad7de7a959cf04970d923b188d317d4f38e2a272de", "ja": "私も、自分のことみたいにうれしくて……だから\nお祝いに、お菓子を作ってこようかなって。", "zh": "我也高兴得就像是自己的事一样……所以想着，要不要做些点心来庆祝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "f455fd1da9ac25000743e011f2f427610c70c0baac5283d0f23a4d888c6631fd", "ja": "未来ちゃん、前に「生クリームが大好き」って\n言ってたから。", "zh": "因为未来之前说过，她最喜欢鲜奶油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1011_p", "source_sha256": "92729ffe1b0282fea7ccdac7c7388829d12d914fd749cfffc15f76d9ef3b7476", "ja": "なるほど、その試食係というわけか。\nそういう事ならもちろん、手伝わせてもらうよ。", "zh": "原来如此，所以你就是试吃员啊。\n既然是这样，当然得让我来帮忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "8097e22646378abb38f0bd39b8d837418dfa91b6dd8c33ddcd8e4fd0bef63bfa", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとうございます！\nどんなお菓子を作ろうかな……？　ふふっ。", "zh": "哇，非常感谢您！\n做点什么点心好呢……？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "bbd3b2bf76e35dee4655ae8f58f534d95d38ce845bf44ea3fb454b026cbb2bc2", "ja": "よーし。おいしいお菓子を作って、\n未来ちゃんをビックリさせちゃおっと。", "zh": "好——做些好吃的点心，让未来大吃一惊吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "c8458b23a43d11428100d29ce400d982e360d2ef14f5a0b7f4610b32b7a929f7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます！\nそれじゃ私、着替えてきますね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢您！\n那我这就去换衣服啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "65ef486f30e2713b08701c9b03a83d988d4a8c1b89967b298c35725f95f510e8", "ja": "……って、きゃああぁっ！？", "zh": "……等等，呀啊啊啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f47d6cb597d51c24436a112da0b5dbcb6755eb2e15a169d39aca1f992bd98a61", "ja": "春香！？", "zh": "春香！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1017_se", "source_sha256": "fde6d9d85129cca12dff6da81dbc031856437130bead827262aee9bcdb59e611", "ja": "どんがらがっしゃーん", "zh": "（摔了一跤）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d4a42d852ca1d05a005527b9bfa9d1e9f8de95cc240a1c0328a6feb6451f7aa8", "ja": "びっくりした……大丈夫か？", "zh": "吓了一跳……没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "ed923dd2fb61cc2ddbc810ad06c288f91a11ea4e9aec937d768150fe3e5c1735", "ja": "す、すみません、転んじゃいました……\n大丈夫です！　それじゃ、また後で！", "zh": "对、对不起，我不小心摔倒了……\n我没事！那待会儿见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0303_1020_p", "source_sha256": "684240f643bbfd40aaa669ac53eac3e1340935919e40ed7cf542c0a6c3a302db", "ja": "（春香、気合いを入れ過ぎてバレないといいけど……\nそれとなくフォローしておくか……）", "zh": "（希望春香别因为太过投入而被看出来才好……还是不动声色地帮她打个圆场吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
